## Implementation Details

### AudioEmotionDetector Class
- Location: elfie/brain/emotion.detector.audio_detector
- Features:
  * Dependency checking (librosa, pyworld)
  * Graceful fallback when dependencies unavailable
  * Audio feature extraction: energy, f0 (pitch), tempo
  * Rule-based emotion classification

### Classification Rules
1. anger: energy > 0.1 AND f0_std > 50 AND tempo > 120
2. sadness: energy < 0.03 AND f0_std < 30
3. happiness: energy > 0.08 AND tempo > 100
4. calm: default case

### Audio Features
- energy (RMS): 振幅/响度
- f0_mean/f0_std: 基频/音高及其变化
- tempo: 语速 (通过onset检测)

